SrcIp IN ("1.*", "2.*", "3.*", "4.*", "5.*", "6.*", "7.*", "8.*", "9.*") UriStem IN ("*/api/auth*", "*/api/login*", "*/api/token*", "*/api/session*", "*/api/password*", "*/auth/api*", "*/v1/auth*", "*/v2/auth*") RequestBody IN ("*username*", "*email*", "*password*", "*pass*", "*pwd*", "*secret*") Method="POST" UserAgent IN ("*curl*", "*wget*", "*python*", "*requests*", "*go-http-client*", "*httpclient*", "*axios*", "*libwww*", "*scanner*", "*probe*") Status IN (401, 403, 404, 422) NOT (UserAgent IN ("*Mozilla*", "*Chrome*", "*Firefox*", "*Safari*", "*Edge*", "*HeadlessChrome*") OR UriStem IN ("*/sso*", "*/oauth*", "*/openid*", "*/saml*", "*/idp*", "*/federation*") OR UserAgent IN ("*nessus*", "*qualys*", "*openvas*", "*acunetix*", "*nuclei*", "*zabbix*", "*prometheus*", "*uptime*", "*pingdom*", "*datadog*", "*newrelic*")) | table SrcIp,Method,UriStem,Status,UserAgent
